# Pairs with TypeOK. The discard records a value outside the copies, which the
# type invariant must reject.
MODULE: TypeOkCutoverDiscardOutsideCopies
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the discard bookkeeping holds a non-copy

--- FIND
    /\ disc' = disc \cup {c}
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: an undeclared value.
    /\ disc' = disc \cup {c, "elsewhere"}
--- END